# Frappe design system

Any change to a Frappe Desk page, Workspace, Form, List, Vue or Frappe UI screen, stylesheet, icon, sidebar, or dock uses the `frappe-design-system` skill. Navigation records also use `frappe-desk-navigation`.

Do not finish UI work on a static CSS check. Render the affected routes, capture 1440×900, 1280×800, and 390×844, and compare them with the native reference named in that skill. Repeat until `verify-report.json` has `"status": "pass"` and `"visual": true`.

If the app cannot be launched, say visual verification did not run. Do not invent a password. Read `FRAPPE_USER` and `FRAPPE_PASSWORD` from the environment.
